      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### \ud83d\udd12 Advanced TLS Fingerprinting & Deception Traps\n* **JA3 / JA4+ TLS Hits:** Matches client hello TLS fingerprints against SSLBL/Abuse.ch threat feeds. Red `> 0` indicates known C2 frameworks (Cobalt Strike, Sliver, Qakbot).\n* **Honeypot Hits:** Any connection to internal deception IP addresses instantly triggers red alerts.\n* **DoH Intercepts:** Intercepts malware trying to bypass local Pi-hole DNS by talking directly to Cloudflare/Google DoH IPs."
      }
