      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### \u2694\ufe0f Internal Lateral Movement & Command-and-Control Beaconing\n* **Lateral Scans:** Detects internal probing across SMB (445), RDP (3389), SSH (22), NetBIOS, and WinRM.\n* **Beaconing C2 Channels:** Measures periodicity ($CV < 0.10$) and traffic concentration to detect automated heartbeats to C2 infrastructure."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "\ud83c\udfaf Active Internal Lateral Movement Probes",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dfm29b4en3im8e"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (hostname) (increase(home_ids_zeek_lateral_events_total{hostname=~\"$device\"}[1h])) > 0",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "hostname": "Attacking Host",
              "Value": "Probes (1h)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "center"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
